      "description": "Centered five-column page navigation, shared by courseware, references and citation views.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-folio\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"页码\"><button class=\"ds-folio-button\" aria-label=\"上一页\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 6-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></button><input class=\"ds-page\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"33\" value=\"7\" aria-label=\"当前页\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span aria-label=\"总页数\">33</span><button class=\"ds-folio-button\" aria-label=\"下一页\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m10 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-folio {box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:28px 40px 12px 40px 28px;align-items:center;gap:2px;min-height:34px;padding:2px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d7d9cf);border-radius:9px;background:transparent;color:var(--reading-ink,#29312d);font:400 14px/28px \"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap} .ds-folio-button {display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer} .ds-folio-button svg {display:block;width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round} .ds-page {box-sizing:border-box;width:40px;min-width:40px;height:28px;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;font:inherit;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;appearance:textfield} .ds-page::-webkit-inner-spin-button,.ds-page::-webkit-outer-spin-button {appearance:none;margin:0} .ds-folio>span {height:28px;text-align:center;font:inherit} .ds-folio-button:hover:not(:disabled) {background:var(--surface,#fefdf7)} .ds-folio-button:disabled {opacity:.4;cursor:default} .ds-folio-button:focus-visible,.ds-page:focus-visible {outline:2px solid var(--accent,#28665f);outline-offset:1px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Parallel Score",
    "overview": "Parallel Score keeps the source page, bilingual reading and question scope in view as parts of the same task. Deep teal identifies the course rail, sand frames the workspace, and warm paper marks the surfaces where people read or write.\n\nCompact controls leave room for the document. Tabular folios and quiet dividers make it easy to track the same page across panes. Course materials supply the imagery.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Deep teal course rail with light text",
      "Warm paper for reading, writing and library surfaces",
      "Compact system controls and tabular folios"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Paper Rule",
        "body": "Use warm paper for reading, composition and grouped materials. Use sand for the workspace around them.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep cards flat at rest. Use soft shadows on floating Ask, dialogs and menus to show that they sit above the workspace.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Folio Rule",
        "body": "Use tabular numerals and the shared five-column page control. Keep page identity in the toolbar and continuous-page boundaries; pane headings name the columns.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the file and folio together in the reading controls.",
      "Do pair status color with a readable label.",
      "Do give keyboard focus a 2px teal outline with a 3px offset."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add decorative illustrations to the workspace."
    ]
  }
}
